CORE
main.c
--pointer-check --witness -
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^          value: "\\\\result == -?[0-9]+"$
^          line: 8$
^        type: "target"$
^          line: 10$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Checks the target of a memory-safety violation in the violation witness in
witness format 2.x.
